  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Records `signer`'s latest observation for `feed_id` and recomputes\\nthe cached aggregate for that feed.\\n\\n# Errors\\n* `NotAuthorizedSigner` - `signer` is not a registered signer.\\n* `InvalidPrice` - `price <= 0`.\\n* `PriceOutOfRange` - `price > MAX_SUBMITTED_PRICE`.\\n* `FutureTimestamp` - `package_timestamp` is more than\\n`MAX_FUTURE_SKEW_SECONDS` ahead of the ledger clock.\\n* `StaleSubmission` - `package_timestamp` is already older than the\\n`MaxSubmissionAgeSeconds` inclusion window.",
      "name": "submit_price",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "signer",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "feed_id",
          "type_": "string"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "price",
          "type_": "i128"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "package_timestamp",
          "type_": "u64"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "void",
            "error_type": "error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Records `signer`'s latest observations for multiple feeds in one\\ncall, sharing a single `package_timestamp` and one auth check. All\\ninputs are validated upfront; no partial application on failure.\\n\\n# Errors\\n* `NotAuthorizedSigner` - `signer` is not a registered signer.\\n* `LengthMismatch` - `feed_ids.len() != prices.len()`.\\n* `InvalidPrice` - any `prices[i] <= 0`.\\n* `PriceOutOfRange` - any `prices[i] > MAX_SUBMITTED_PRICE`.\\n* `FutureTimestamp` - the shared `package_timestamp` is more than\\n`MAX_FUTURE_SKEW_SECONDS` ahead of the ledger clock.\\n* `StaleSubmission` - the shared `package_timestamp` is already older\\nthan the `MaxSubmissionAgeSeconds` inclusion window.",
      "name": "submit_prices",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "signer",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "feed_ids",
          "type_": {
            "vec": {
              "element_type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "prices",
          "type_": {
            "vec": {
              "element_type": "i128"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "package_timestamp",
          "type_": "u64"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "void",
            "error_type": "error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
